description	"Durge

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^1-- Heavyweight
- Wrist Energy Shields ^9(Dual Saber)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
^2-- Radius: 5
^1-- Prim Fire: No
^1-- BP Regen: 0
^1-- Length: 35
- Durge's Blaster Pistols ^9(WESTAR 3)
^2-- Damage: 1.15x
^2-- Drain: 1.3x
^1-- RoF: .85x
- Flechette Gatling Gauntlet ^9(Arm Blaster 3)
^1-- Damage: .8x
^2-- Drain: 1.5x
^2-- RoF: 1.1x
^1-- Sec Fire: No

^3Abilities:
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS2]
- Jetpack ^3[Hold/2x Jump]

^5Powers:
- Cybernetic Tracking Implant ^9(Sense 1) ^3[CS3]
- Rage (3) ^3[CS1]
- Anti-Force Field ^9(Absorb 2) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Strength (2)
- Armor Regen (2)
- Healing (2)
^2-- Regenerate: 5/10s > 100
- Fury (2)
- Getup (1)
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Beskar (2)
- Blast Armor
- Brawler Guard
- Wookalike
^2- Knockback Taken: .75x
^1- Skill Recharge:  .8x

A tanky dual pistoleer/brawler class equipped with a Jetpack and tools meant for destroying Jedi."
